- tdh_sept_seamcall() -> tdx_seamcall_sept() in comments. (Binbin)
- Do not open code TDX_ERROR_SEPT_BUSY. (Binbin)
- "TDH.VP.ENTRY" -> "TDH.VP.ENTER". (Binbin)
---
