From 706d4cffa120b01d5ce434c253da1bd1f1c5bcec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sagi Shahar <sagis@google.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Jun 2024 13:29:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 127/135] KVM: TDX: Fix possible invalid memory access in
 tdx_gmem_post_populate

tdx_gmem_post_populate is not guarenteed to run after the mmu has been
loaded so kvm_tdp_mmu_get_walk_mirror_pfn can result in illegal memory
access when trying to access the mmu roots.

